@startuml 14_ui_navigation
title UI Navigation Model (core client workflow)
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description
skinparam state<<planned>> {
  BackgroundColor #EEEEEE
  BorderColor #888888
  FontColor #666666
}

[*] --> Connect
state "1 Connect" as Connect
state "2 Lobby" as Lobby
state "3 Waiting Room" as Waiting
state "4 Match" as Match
state "5 Result" as Result

Connect --> Lobby : ConnectResponse and AuthResponse
Connect --> Connect : ErrorResponse (version, auth)\nshow banner
Lobby --> Waiting : StateUpdate (create or join succeeded)
Lobby --> Lobby : ErrorResponse (not found, not joinable)\nshow banner
Waiting --> Match : StateUpdate with status IN_PROGRESS
Waiting --> Lobby : LeaveSessionResponse
Match --> Match : StateUpdate (redraw)\nErrorResponse (banner, snap back)
Match --> Result : MatchResult
Result --> Waiting : Ready for rematch
Result --> Lobby : LeaveSessionResponse
Match --> Lobby : LeaveSessionResponse (forfeit)
Connect --> Connect : connection closed (from any screen)

state "Reconnecting" as Reconnect <<planned>>
Match --> Reconnect : connection lost
Reconnect --> Match : AuthRequest(player_id, token) accepted
Reconnect --> Connect : grace period expired
@enduml
